grounding.zh:
问题：{question}
回答：{answer}

在这张图里，找出与上面回答最直接相关的那一个界面元素或位置（例如该点的按钮、出错的那个数字、被提到的那一项）。只输出 JSON，格式为 {"point_2d": [x, y], "label": "不超过六个字"}。

grounding.en:
Question: {question}
Answer: {answer}

In this image, locate the single UI element or spot that the answer refers to most directly (the button to press, the number that is wrong, the item mentioned). Output JSON only, as {"point_2d": [x, y], "label": "at most four words"}.
